  "title": "西部往事",
  "storyCode": "GT-HX-3",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_ex06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "53f5a4c58807f95b3e2582f0b4f5b1ad232516af7ece080ddcf489f142a6bd7b",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_infirmary"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "站住，凱爾希。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你回來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在你是想通了，還是怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想要這個對吧，拿去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你私自出動了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不干涉幹員的私事，也不會過問他們做了些什麼，只要他們沒有損害羅德島的利益。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希望你的行為不要有失你在羅德島的身份，斯卡蒂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "冷嘲熱諷就免了。規矩我很清楚，一物換一物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想要從我這裡換到什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "訊息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我所擁有的訊息的價值，真有這麼輕賤？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可以立刻就把這塊石頭捏成碎片，你不會希望我這麼做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我知道你假稱任務，去了卡西米爾的滴水村，還和其他幹員發生了衝突。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個孩子無論是在滴水村還是在羅德島，都替你保守了秘密。但我絕沒有向你發佈過任何類似的任務。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？血已經注滿了融芯。這不是你的血，你不敢在大地上流血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是格拉尼的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你已經做了這種事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會回報她，這不用你提醒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道你需要這東西，鑰匙、核心、記憶塊，隨便它是什麼。我必須弄到手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“顱腔”，“火肺”，“黃煙”，我全都解決了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "否則，這東西早已落到他們手上了。而和他們交易的絕不會是你，因為你給不出他們要的東西，你不會做那種事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你需要這塊“石頭”，我需要知道我想知道的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你和你的種群讓我感到可笑，我並不依賴任何一個零件去拼湊出大地的全貌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你與羅德島由契約相連，你與我也當如是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一物換一物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難得看見你惱怒的樣子。只有在這種時候，你才會一改平常的慵懶和頹廢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想知道幽靈鯊身上源石神經劑的來源。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——你是怎麼知道的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（阿戈爾語）“深海獵人血脈相連”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我無所不知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......告訴我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_infirmary"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可以。只要你聽我的命令，我甚至會主動幫助你。前提是，你必須聽從命令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只相信可信之人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我言而有信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
